Template: xapsd/key-file-topic
Type: string
_Description: APNS topic:
 Enter the application bundle identifier used as the Apple Push Notification
 Service topic.

Template: xapsd/key-file-key-id
Type: string
_Description: Apple APNS key ID:
 Enter the key ID shown for the APNS authentication key in the Apple Developer
 portal.

Template: xapsd/key-file-team-id
Type: string
_Description: Apple Developer team ID:
 Enter the team ID associated with the APNS authentication key.
